  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIn https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/1409 we changed where `attachShadow()` gets its initial registry from, but we didn't change how the HTML parser does it. We probably should have?\n\n(See also #11892 for related fallout of that change.)\n\ncc @ja-y-son @sorvell @rniwa @Jamesernator ",
